    <testimonials>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "b1010003-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000003",
      "key": "a3000003-0003-4003-8003-000000000001",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "c6e8e080-acaf-4650-b2c0-de1126bbb1a3",
              "mediaKey": "e1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111201",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "I just wanted to say thank you so much for making this such a seamless transition. Centro made it so easy to get everyone up and going first thing without any questions Also, thank you for all the work you have been putting in to ensure we can test the migration appropriately while the agents are still working."
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorName",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sara Cruz"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorTitle",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Nationwide Medical, Inc."
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorRole",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Director of Operation"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "b1010003-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000003",
      "key": "a3000003-0003-4003-8003-000000000002",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "31111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111402",
              "mediaKey": "e1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111202",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Service Desk support has exceeded expectations. Their ability to both problems solve and offer solutions while supporting customers and FIT staff has been extremely valuable and appreciated"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorName",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Matthew Antonishak"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorTitle",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Fluence"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorRole",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "IT Service Desk Manager"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "b1010003-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000003",
      "key": "a3000003-0003-4003-8003-000000000003",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "31111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111403",
              "mediaKey": "e1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111203",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Centro has been a critical partner in our international expansion efforts, especially as it pertains to our learning as we\u2019ve opened up new markets in Europe as we open up our French market, their flexibility and ability to partner with us to test and learn to establish new strategies"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorName",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Nevena Trainor"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorTitle",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Pampered Chef"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorRole",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Chief Executive Officer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "b1010003-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000003",
      "key": "a3000003-0003-4003-8003-000000000004",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "image",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            {
              "key": "31111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111404",
              "mediaKey": "e1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111204",
              "mediaTypeAlias": "Image",
              "crops": [],
              "focalPoint": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "alias": "quote",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Centro has taken most of our global support and they\u2019ve done an amazing job, been able to support our customers through some very difficult time, through the pandemic, where we grew the business exceptionally fast, and Centro was able to keep up providing an excellent quality of services to our customers"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorName",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Andrew Treanor"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorTitle",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Pampered Chef"
        },
        {
          "alias": "authorRole",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Former Chief Executive Officer"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
